WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:08.130
This is the Earth, at a time when the dinosaurs roamed a lush, fertile planet.
这就是地球，当时恐龙漫步在一个郁郁葱葱、生机勃勃的星球上。

2
00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:21.370
A piece of rock just six miles wide changed all that.
一块只有六英里宽的岩石改变了这一切。

3
00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:33.690
It hit with a force of 10,000 nuclear weapons.
它撞击时产生的威力相当于一万颗核武器。

4
00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:44.370
A trillion tons of dirt and rock hurtled into the atmosphere, creating a suffocating blanket of duSt.
一万亿吨的泥土和岩石冲向大气层，形成了一层令人窒息的尘埃毯。

5
00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:48.570
The sun was powerless to penetrate for a thousand years.
太阳在一千年里都无法穿透它。

6
00:00:57.220 --> 00:00:58.640
It happened before.
以前发生过。

7
00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:02.460
It'll happen again.
以后还会发生。

8
00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:07.160
It's just a question of when.
这只是个时间问题。

9
00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:14.780
Everyone, buckle in for Armageddon.
大家系好安全带，迎接世界末日吧。

10
00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:26.390
I'm Jenna Fisher.
我是珍娜·费舍。

11
00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:27.790
And I'm Angela Kinsey.
我是安吉拉·金西。

12
00:01:27.950 --> 00:01:30.610
We were on The Office together, and we're best friends.
我们曾一起出演《办公室》，而且我们是最好的朋友。

13
00:01:30.630 --> 00:01:34.770
And now we're doing the ultimate Office Lovers podcast just for you.
现在，我们专为您打造了终极的《办公室》爱好者播客。

14
00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:42.430
Each week, we will dive deeper into the world of The Office with exclusive interviews, behind-the-scenes details, and lots of BFF stories.
每周，我们都会通过独家采访、幕后细节和大量闺蜜故事，带您深入《办公室》的世界。

15
00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:44.510
We're The Office Lady 6.0.
我们是《办公室女士 6.0版》。

16
00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:52.400
A big, big episode today.
今天有一期非常非常重要的节目。

17
00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:53.760
We really do.
我们真的是这么想的。

18
00:01:54.220 --> 00:02:00.760
Welcome to our breakdown of the 1998 summer blockbuster Armageddon.
欢迎收听我们对1998年夏季大片《绝世天劫》的深度解析。

19
00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:04.720
Explosions!
爆炸！

20
00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:10.360
We said we might do this a while back, and we got mail.
我们不久前说过可能会做这个，然后我们收到了来信。

21
00:02:11.300 --> 00:02:11.880
Amber W.
来自密歇根州布赖顿的

22
00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:13.860
