As you said, Jenna, it was released in 1998 on July 1St.
正如你所说，珍娜，它于1998年7月1日上映。

67
00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:07.830
So, kind of like around the July 4th holiday.
所以，差不多是在7月4日独立日假期前后。

68
00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:08.390
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

69
00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:08.990
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

70
