84
00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:40.670
Oh, that's very good.
哦，那非常好。

85
00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:41.170
Yeah.
是的。

86
00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:41.670
Yeah.
是的。

87
00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:42.110
Mm-hmm.
