118
00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:04.430
if you want to make a lot of money, find something you can sell to middle America.
如果你想赚大钱，就去找一样能卖给美国中部大众的东西。

119
00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:05.450
Okay.
好吧。

120
00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:07.230
