132
00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:35.170
Two hours and 35 minutes.
两小时三十五分钟。

133
00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:35.630
Okay.
好吧。

134
00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:36.650
Yeah.
对。

135
00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:39.650
It is real long.
这片子真长。

136
00:06:39.910 --> 00:06:40.550
Real long.
真长。

137
00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:41.850
