2180
01:33:13.600 --> 01:33:13.960
Yeah.
是啊。

2181
01:33:13.960 --> 01:33:20.000
And oh, I also cried when Colonel Sharp wanted to shake Grace's hand because her dad was the
哦，当夏普上校想和格蕾丝握手时我也哭了，因为她爸爸是

2182
01:33:20.000 --> 01:33:20.280
hero.
英雄。

2183
01:33:20.280 --> 01:33:26.340
He said, I wanted to shake the hand of the daughter of the man who saved the world.
他说，我想和那个拯救了世界的男人的女儿握手。

2184
01:33:26.340 --> 01:33:27.360
It's very moving.
这非常感人。

2185
01:33:27.600 --> 01:33:32.240
You know, I have a clip from the DVD commentary where Bruce Willis talked about what it was
你知道的，我有一段DVD评论音轨的片段，里面布鲁斯·威利斯谈到了

2186
01:33:32.240 --> 01:33:33.400
like to work on this movie.
参演这部电影的感受。

2187
01:33:33.580 --> 01:33:34.220
Let's hear it.
我们听听看。

2188
01:33:34.820 --> 01:33:38.680
It was a nice change for me working with an ensemble cast like we had in Armageddon.
对我来说，能和《绝世天劫》里这样的一群演员合作是一个很好的转变。

2189
01:33:39.380 --> 01:33:40.860
All really funny guys.
大家都是非常有趣的人。

2190
01:33:41.880 --> 01:33:47.740
My strongest memory of now is how much we laughed every day and just try to keep cracking
我现在最深刻的记忆是，我们每天都在大笑，试图互相逗乐。

2191
01:33:47.740 --> 01:33:48.400
each other up.
互相开玩笑。

2192
01:33:48.860 --> 01:33:51.140
So it sounds like they had a really good time.
听起来他们过得很开心。

2193
01:33:51.140 --> 01:33:55.540
This movie, it has a tag over the credits.
这部电影在演职员表滚动时还有一个彩蛋。

2194
01:33:55.800 --> 01:33:56.040
It does.
确实有。

2195
01:33:56.380 --> 01:33:58.040
AJ and Grace get married.
AJ和格蕾丝结婚了。

2196
01:33:58.280 --> 01:33:59.160
I loved that.
我很喜欢那个。

2197
01:33:59.160 --> 01:34:00.020
It was lovely.
这很美好。

2198
01:34:00.280 --> 01:34:01.000
It made me happy.
这让我感到高兴。

2199
01:34:01.460 --> 01:34:03.040
And then the movie's over.
然后电影就结束了。

2200
01:34:03.140 --> 01:34:03.800
And that's it.
就这样了。

2201
01:34:03.940 --> 01:34:04.520
That's it.
就这样了。

2202
01:34:04.640 --> 01:34:05.180
You did it.
你做到了。

2203
01:34:05.300 --> 01:34:06.860
Two hours and 31 minutes.
两小时三十一分钟。

2204
01:34:07.380 --> 01:34:08.520
You have one note.
你有一个意见。

2205
01:34:08.740 --> 01:34:08.920
Yeah.
对。

2206
01:34:09.660 --> 01:34:15.340
I just think that during that final slow motion montage of everyone on Earth being happy
我只是觉得在最后那个慢镜头蒙太奇里，地球上的每个人都很高兴

2207
01:34:15.340 --> 01:34:20.780
that the meteor was destroyed, it would have been really nice if we could have just seen
流星被摧毁了，如果我们能看到

2208
01:34:20.780 --> 01:34:22.400
Bike Guy hugging his dog.
骑车男抱着他的狗，那就太好了。

2209
01:34:22.580 --> 01:34:22.820
Yeah.
对。

2210
01:34:22.980 --> 01:34:26.560
And maybe Telescope Guy and his wife Dottie hugging or something.
也许还有望远镜男和他的妻子多蒂拥抱或者别的什么。

2211
01:34:26.780 --> 01:34:26.960
Yeah.
对。

2212
01:34:27.100 --> 01:34:31.540
Just some resolution on those characters that we set up in the cold open of this movie.
只是给我们在电影冷开场中设置的那些角色一个交代。

2213
01:34:31.720 --> 01:34:32.360
Oh, yeah.
哦，对。

2214
01:34:32.480 --> 01:34:33.020
I agree.
我同意。

2215
01:34:33.040 --> 01:34:37.920
I would love to have seen the dog with like a Godzilla toy in his mouth, shaking it.
我真的很想看到那只狗嘴里叼着个哥斯拉玩具，摇晃着。

2216
01:34:38.280 --> 01:34:38.520
Something.
随便什么都行。

2217
01:34:38.520 --> 01:34:42.500
And maybe Dottie flipping off her husband, but like with a smile.
也许还有多蒂向她丈夫竖中指，但带着微笑。

2218
01:34:42.700 --> 01:34:42.960
Yeah.
对。

2219
01:34:43.180 --> 01:34:44.060
Like, F you.
就像是，去你的吧。

2220
01:34:44.340 --> 01:34:44.920
We did it.
我们做到了。

2221
01:34:45.200 --> 01:34:45.460
Yeah.
对。

2222
01:34:46.040 --> 01:34:47.640
If I had been in the room.
要是我当时在房间里的话。

2223
01:34:47.980 --> 01:34:48.320
Yeah.
对。

2224
01:34:48.440 --> 01:34:49.740
I would have given that note.
我就会提出那个意见了。

2225
01:34:50.140 --> 01:34:50.360
Yeah.
对。

2226
01:34:50.760 --> 01:34:51.040
I would.
我会的。

2227
01:34:51.360 --> 01:34:51.420
No.
不。

2228
01:34:52.740 --> 01:34:53.380
Just the one.
就这一个。

2229
01:34:53.660 --> 01:34:54.160
Otherwise, otherwise.
除此之外，除此之外。

2230
01:34:54.520 --> 01:34:55.600
Don't change anything.
什么都别改。

2231
01:34:55.860 --> 01:34:56.660
Don't change a thing.
一点都别改。

2232
01:34:57.000 --> 01:35:00.680
Definitely keep in the leaving on a jet plane sequence.
绝对要保留乘喷气式飞机离开的那段戏。

2233
01:35:04.140 --> 01:35:05.720
Sam, final thoughts?
萨姆，最后有什么想法？

2234
01:35:06.320 --> 01:35:07.360
I love it.
我太喜欢了。

2235
01:35:07.360 --> 01:35:08.460
It's not good.
这片子不咋地。

2236
01:35:08.460 --> 01:35:09.220
I love it.
我太喜欢了。

2237
01:35:09.300 --> 01:35:10.240
That's a great quote.
这评价绝了。

2238
01:35:10.240 --> 01:35:12.140
It's not good, but I love it.
片子不咋地，但我超喜欢。

2239
01:35:12.220 --> 01:35:13.040
That's how I feel.
我就是这种感觉。

2240
01:35:13.320 --> 01:35:13.580
Yeah.
对。

2241
01:35:14.040 --> 01:35:16.840
I'm excited to know that they had a good time, you know?
知道他们玩得很开心，我挺兴奋的，你知道吗？

2242
01:35:17.080 --> 01:35:22.380
And I really look forward to the road trip you and I take where we listen to the DVD
我真的很期待你和我一起的那场公路旅行，我们可以听着DVD

2243
01:35:22.380 --> 01:35:23.040
commentary.
随片评论。

2244
01:35:23.480 --> 01:35:24.620
Can I add something real quick?
我能快速补充一句吗？

2245
01:35:24.760 --> 01:35:24.900
Yeah.
行。

2246
01:35:25.000 --> 01:35:25.260
Yes.
可以。

2247
01:35:25.600 --> 01:35:31.260
I really admire all of your work breaking down this movie, your attention to detail.
我真的很佩服你剖析这部电影的所有工作，你对细节的关注。

2248
01:35:31.460 --> 01:35:32.720
I found it so exhausting.
我觉得这太累人了。

2249
01:35:32.720 --> 01:35:37.760
And the way you really got in there, took the whole thing seriously, looked into everything.
还有你那种深入其中、把整部电影当回事、什么都去研究的态度。

2250
01:35:37.860 --> 01:35:38.600
I'm in awe.
我五体投地。

2251
01:35:38.760 --> 01:35:39.180
Well done.
干得好。

2252
01:35:39.420 --> 01:35:40.720
Oh, thanks, Matt.
哦，谢谢，马特。

2253
01:35:40.780 --> 01:35:41.220
Thank you, Matt.
谢谢你，马特。

2254
01:35:41.540 --> 01:35:43.480
We love a movie breakdown, guys.
各位，我们很喜欢电影解析。

2255
01:35:43.620 --> 01:35:46.360
If there's another one you think we got to tackle, let us know.
如果你觉得还有哪部是我们必须聊聊的，请告诉我们。

2256
01:35:46.720 --> 01:35:49.600
Write to us over at officeladies.com in our general mail folder.
给我们写信，通过 officeladies.com 的常规邮件文件夹。

2257
01:35:49.840 --> 01:35:51.360
And we'll see you next week.
我们下周见。

2258
01:35:51.500 --> 01:35:51.920
See you then.
到时见。

2259
01:35:51.920 --> 01:35:57.420
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies.
感谢收听《办公室女士》。

